OL,3,GNEWSANormandy veteran Henry Rice dies
OL,4,Aaged 100
OL,5,
OL,6,FWorld War Two veteran Henry Rice, who
OL,7,Fsurvived a near-miss when a torpedo was
OL,8,Ffired at the boat he was on, has died
OL,9,Fat the age of 100.
OL,11,FRice, from Cranleigh in Surrey, was a
OL,12,Fsignalman aboard HMS Eastway as part of
OL,13,Fthe Normandy landings, arriving at Juno
OL,14,FBeach five days after D-Day.
OL,16,FHe received the Legion d'honneur from
OL,17,Fthe French government and had called
OL,18,Ffor schools to teach children more
OL,19,Fabout the Normandy landings because the
OL,20,F"world is dangerous at the moment".
OL,23,APub: 12-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
