OL,3,GNEWSANormandy veteran Henry Rice dies
OL,4,Aaged 100
OL,5,
OL,6,FA spokesperson from the Spirit of
OL,7,FNormandy Trust, a charity for veterans,
OL,8,Fsaid: "Henry was a great character,
OL,9,Fwith a cheeky smile that endeared him
OL,10,Fto everyone he met."
